This product builds on DC-AE (Deep Compression Autoencoder) by MIT HAN Lab and NVIDIA:
  Junyu Chen, Han Cai, Junsong Chen, Enze Xie, Shang Yang, Haotian Tang, Muyang Li, Yao Lu, Song Han.
  "Deep Compression Autoencoder for Efficient High-Resolution Diffusion Models", arXiv:2410.10733.
  https://github.com/dc-ai-projects/DC-Gen (Apache License 2.0)

The released file decoder.safetensors is the decoder of
mit-han-lab/dc-ae-lite-f32c32-sana-1.1-diffusers, MODIFIED: fine-tuned on frames of this project's simulator
(wm/ae_tune.py). encoder.safetensors is a different network (a ConvNeXt-S) trained to reproduce the output of that
autoencoder's encoder.
